sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Intern
  participant I as intership-service
  participant G as GitHub
  actor E as Supervisor
  participant A as AI assistant
  participant K as Kafka
  alt file
    S->>I: POST /missions/{id}/deliverables
  else commit
    S->>I: POST /missions/{id}/commit-submissions
    Note over I: linked Git identity, one commit per repository
  end
  I-->>S: mission To do or Rejected → In progress
  E->>I: opens the proofs
  I->>G: files changed by the commit
  G-->>E: diff, file by file
  opt AI opinion
    E->>A: POST review-assistant
    A-->>E: suggested verdict, proposed comment
  end
  E->>I: Approve, Needs changes or Reject
  alt Needs changes or Reject
    Note over E,I: comment required
  else every member's latest proof accepted
    I->>I: mission Completed, team points
  end
  E->>I: PUT /missions/{id}/validate
  I->>K: points and skills events
  K-->>S: notification
